---
import SiteLayout from '../layouts/SiteLayout.astro';

const meta = {
  title: 'Get Involved | Volunteer & Support Sunbright Recovery',
  description:
    'Volunteer, sponsor a space, or partner with us. Help Sunbright Recovery Center bring nonprofit addiction recovery to Northern California.',
  primaryKeyword: 'volunteer addiction recovery',
};

const breadcrumbs = [
  { name: 'Home', url: '/' },
  { name: 'Get Involved', url: '/get-involved' },
];
---

<SiteLayout {...meta} breadcrumbs={breadcrumbs}>
  <header class="page-header">
    <div class="wrap ph-inner">
      <span class="eyebrow">Get Involved</span>
      <h1>There are more ways to help than <em>writing a check.</em></h1>
      <p class="lead">Recovery takes a community. Sunbright Recovery Center is a 501(c)(3) nonprofit, and we are built to be sustained by the people around us — through time, skills, relationships, and generosity in every form. Here is how you can be part of what we are building.</p>
      <div class="btn-row">
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us to Get Started</a>
        <a href="tel:+15305282342" class="btn btn-ghost">Call (530) 528-2342</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="section section--white">
    <div class="wrap split">
      <div class="prose wide">
        <p>The people who recover at Sunbright don't do it alone — and neither do we. From clinicians and community leaders to churches, contractors, and neighbors who believe that Northern California deserves better access to addiction care, our community makes the mission possible.</p>
        <p>There are many ways to invest yourself in this work. Not all of them cost money. All of them matter.</p>

        <h2>Volunteer your time and skills</h2>
        <p>We welcome volunteers who can bring something meaningful to the center and to the people recovering here. Opportunities include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li><strong>Lead a class or workshop.</strong> Teach a life-skills session, a fitness class, an art workshop, a financial literacy course, or anything else you do well. People in recovery benefit enormously from outside voices who invest in them.</li>
          <li><strong>Mentoring and peer support.</strong> If you are in long-term recovery yourself, consider sharing your story and your time. Peer mentors are one of the most powerful forces in sustained recovery.</li>
          <li><strong>Grounds and facility beautification.</strong> Our Northern California setting is part of what makes this place healing. Volunteers who can help with landscaping, painting, repairs, or general upkeep are always welcome.</li>
          <li><strong>Administrative and professional support.</strong> Grant writing, legal, accounting, marketing, and communications — if you have professional skills to offer, there is almost certainly a way to put them to work here.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>All volunteers complete a brief orientation and any necessary background screening. Reach out through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a> to start a conversation about how your skills might fit.</p>

        <h2>Sponsor a space</h2>
        <p>One of the most tangible ways to invest in the center is to sponsor a physical space. Named sponsorships are available for individual rooms, beds, common areas, and the chapel. Your name — or the name of someone you want to honor — becomes part of the healing environment we provide to every person who passes through.</p>
        <p>Sponsorships are recognized with a named plaque and acknowledged in our communications to supporters. All sponsorship gifts are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law. To discuss options and naming opportunities, please call us or send a message through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

        <h2>Church &amp; community partnerships</h2>
        <p>Faith communities and civic organizations are among our most important partners. We are a faith-integrated center — not faith-exclusive — and we deeply value the role that churches, mosques, and community organizations play in walking alongside people in recovery.</p>
        <p>Ways to partner include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Hosting a fundraising event or awareness night for your congregation or group</li>
          <li>Providing chaplaincy, pastoral care, or spiritual direction volunteers</li>
          <li>Sponsoring a resident's care through a church giving fund</li>
          <li>Connecting us with local resources, services, and professional networks</li>
          <li>Becoming a referral partner for community members seeking treatment</li>
        </ul>
        <p>We would love to meet with your leadership team. Call us at <a href="tel:+15305282342">(530) 528-2342</a> or reach out through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>

        <h2>In-kind donations</h2>
        <p>We gratefully accept in-kind gifts that directly improve the lives of people in our care. Current needs include:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Household furnishings — beds, linens, towels, comfortable seating</li>
          <li>Kitchenware and dining supplies</li>
          <li>Books, journals, art supplies, and recreational materials</li>
          <li>Clothing and personal hygiene items (new only)</li>
          <li>Professional services — legal, accounting, marketing, construction</li>
        </ul>
        <p>Please contact us before bringing items to the center so we can confirm current needs and coordinate delivery. Qualifying in-kind donations may be tax-deductible — please consult your tax advisor.</p>

        <div class="callout">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          <p><strong>Prefer to give financially?</strong> Visit our <a href="/donate">Donate page</a> to learn about financial giving and how gifts are used. All cash and check contributions to Sunbright Recovery Center are tax-deductible to the extent allowed by law.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <aside class="aside">
        <h3>Ways to get involved</h3>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Volunteer time &amp; skills
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Sponsor a room, bed, or space
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Church &amp; community partnerships
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          In-kind donations
        </div>
        <div class="aside-row">
          <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"/></svg>
          Professional pro-bono services
        </div>
        <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Get in Touch</a>
        <a href="/donate" class="btn btn-navy" style="margin-top:10px">Make a Financial Gift</a>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--cream">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="sec-head">
        <span class="eyebrow">Four ways to invest</span>
        <h2>Pick the path that fits <em>your gifts</em></h2>
      </div>
      <div class="grid grid-3">
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8v4l3 3m6-3a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Give your time</h3>
          <p>Lead a class, mentor a resident, or help us maintain the center. Time is one of the most personal gifts you can offer — and the people in our care feel it.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="card-link">Volunteer with us <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M19 21V5a2 2 0 00-2-2H7a2 2 0 00-2 2v16m14 0h2m-2 0h-5m-9 0H3m2 0h5M9 7h1m-1 4h1m4-4h1m-1 4h1m-2 10v-5a1 1 0 011-1h2a1 1 0 011 1v5m-4 0h4"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Sponsor a space</h3>
          <p>Name a room, a bed, or a common area in honor of someone you love — or simply because you believe in what this place stands for. Every space named becomes a lasting part of the story.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="card-link">Ask about naming <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
        <div class="card">
          <div class="card-icon">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M17 20h5v-2a3 3 0 00-5.356-1.857M17 20H7m10 0v-2c0-.656-.126-1.283-.356-1.857M7 20H2v-2a3 3 0 015.356-1.857M7 20v-2c0-.656.126-1.283.356-1.857m0 0a5.002 5.002 0 019.288 0M15 7a3 3 0 11-6 0 3 3 0 016 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <h3>Partner with your community</h3>
          <p>Churches, civic organizations, and neighborhood groups can support recovery in Tehama County and across Northern California in ways that go far beyond a single donation. Let's build something together.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="card-link">Explore a partnership <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2.5"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M9 5l7 7-7 7"/></svg></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section section--white section--tight">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="features" style="max-width:760px;margin:0 auto">
        <div class="sec-head left" style="margin-bottom:36px">
          <span class="eyebrow">More about Sunbright</span>
          <h2>Learn more about the <em>mission</em></h2>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="f-ic">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M13 16h-1v-4h-1m1-4h.01M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Who we are</h3>
            <p>Read about our founding, our nonprofit structure, and the team behind Sunbright Recovery Center on our <a href="/about">About page</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="f-ic">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M12 8c-1.657 0-3 .895-3 2s1.343 2 3 2 3 .895 3 2-1.343 2-3 2m0-8c1.11 0 2.08.402 2.599 1M12 8V7m0 1v8m0 0v1m0-1c-1.11 0-2.08-.402-2.599-1M21 12a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Make a financial gift</h3>
            <p>Every dollar given to Sunbright goes to care — not investors or shareholders. Learn more and find out how to give on our <a href="/donate">Donate page</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="feature">
          <div class="f-ic">
            <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M3 5a2 2 0 012-2h3.28a1 1 0 01.948.684l1.498 4.493a1 1 0 01-.502 1.21l-2.257 1.13a11.042 11.042 0 005.516 5.516l1.13-2.257a1 1 0 011.21-.502l4.493 1.498a1 1 0 01.684.949V19a2 2 0 01-2 2h-1C9.716 21 3 14.284 3 6V5z"/></svg>
          </div>
          <div>
            <h3>Get in touch</h3>
            <p>The best first step is a conversation. Call us at <a href="tel:+15305282342">(530) 528-2342</a> or reach out through our <a href="/contact">contact page</a>.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-band">
    <span class="eyebrow">Join the mission</span>
    <h2>Recovery takes a community. <em>Be part of ours.</em></h2>
    <p>Whether you have time, skills, a church connection, or a generous heart — there is a place for you in this work. Reach out and let's find the right fit together.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a href="/contact" class="btn btn-gold">Contact Us Today</a>
      <a href="tel:+15305282342" class="btn btn-ghost">Call (530) 528-2342</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</SiteLayout>
